(text "OPEN ELECTRICAL ITEMS\n- Input ESD / fault protection and unpowered backfeed not designed yet.\n- 3V3 supply margin, carrier decoupling and cable capacitance to be checked.\n- ADC acquisition/leakage budget and sensor disconnection handling remain open.\n- No automatic motor stop threshold is defined by this sheet." (at 12.7 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fb8c19a7-c4d1-45b1-8722-82bbc90ac99d"))
(text "OPEN MECHANICAL ITEMS\n- Connector models and resistor/capacitor body envelopes are provisional.\n- Template header positions only; actual socket height / clearance not verified.\n- Keep RESET / USER / jumpers / ST-LINK access and cable strain relief.\n- A clean ERC is not proof of these electrical or mechanical conditions." (at 213.36 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ee9f88c-a726-4e10-9cfe-559a94834d22"))
